60
00:02:22,140 --> 00:02:23,160
Hi, everybody.

61
00:02:23,340 --> 00:02:24,360
- Hey, Art.

62
00:02:23,340 --> 00:02:24,360
Hey, Art.

63
00:02:24,540 --> 00:02:26,030
No.

64
00:02:27,910 --> 00:02:29,670
There's nothing to be ashamed of, son.

65
00:02:29,850 --> 00:02:32,820
Sometimes thunder still frightens me

66
00:02:29,850 --> 00:02:32,820
