67
00:02:33,450 --> 00:02:36,110
- Art, go play with your blowtorch.

68
00:02:33,450 --> 00:02:36,110
- Yeah, I plan to, sir.

69
00:02:36,280 --> 00:02:38,690
I gotta secure the signal tower

70
