282
00:12:28,640 --> 00:12:31,340
- They're cute.

283
00:12:28,640 --> 00:12:31,340
- Ugh.

284
00:12:31,510 --> 00:12:33,110
Cute?

285
00:12:33,280 --> 00:12:36,270
